That would certainly explain why in about 30 minutes of trying I couldn't summon a blue pet last.  The lower level also means that the pets hitpoints will be adjusted down as well.<P>I also noticed a long time ago that our pets life tap proc was severely nerfed.  Being a fear kiter my pets rarely get hit, and I used to enjoy doing /pet health report 58% (you hear the proc) /pet health report 59% (proc) 60% (proc) 61%.  Now I can do /pet health report 58%, (proc) (proc) (proc) (proc) (proc) /pet health report 58%.<P>The pets don't regen at all during a fight, and now their lifetap must be like the level 5 tap or something...  (been that way for half a year at least)<P>I'm just wondering how many of the new Luclin necro spells will require Blue Diamonds or Jacinths as components?   <IMG SRC="smile.gif" border="0">  Or maybe they'll just use Journey Man's boots as components.  <IMG SRC="biggrin.gif" border="0">
