From what I've heard, the pet aggro is somewhere in between the original aggro, and the "bugged" aggro.  I have a hard time believing that mages are wanted any less than they were a couple days ago.  They weren't really all that wanted to begin with, but thats beside the point.  How would you feel if your 49th level earth pet dropped 2 levels overnight, and lost its hitpoints and melee abilities as well?  I'll bet you'd be just as pissed as I am.  Can we just leave mages out of this conversation?  it has nothingto do with them.  <P>As far as the not casting spells go, that isn't the pet issue i'm talking about.  For about 6 months now, the necro pet procs his lifetap, but it only does damage to the target, it doesn't give anything back to the pet.  Its a bug, and its never been fixed.  Its completely unrelated to the crap they did yesterday.  For those who don't know how "lifetap" spells work... They do x damage to the target, and heal x damage to the caster/proccer.  If it was working like it used to it would be:<P>Jobober procs on target, drains target for 45 damage.<BR>Jobober receives 45 hitpoints.<P>It now work like:<P>Jobober procs on target, drains target for 45 damage.<BR>Jobober receives 0 hitpoints.<P>Verser, you act is if this is a good thing for necros, as you said to me, "you get no sympathy from me.  You don't even need your pet."  Thats complete bullshit and you know it.  Sure, I can root/dot some melee mobs in the game, whoopdy-friggin-do.  So can Ghall, so can a LOT of classes.  That sure as hell doesn't mean I don't need my pet.  Take away the necro pet and what have you got?  You got crap!  I've never professed that mages are any better than they are, and I support any class that comes forward with a valid complaint about a nerf.  If you could take off your rose-tinted glasses and just LOOK at the extremely long list of nerfs that the necro class has endured, maybe you wouldn't say those kinds of things.  grrrr<P>--------------------<P>Lownar Baardeth - 54th Level Gnecromancer<BR>Kalaan - 30th Level Rogue<BR>Bertox. Server<P>Sendil- 50th Level Rogue<BR>Solusek Ro Server
