Every class has been or will be nerfed.  As the game and tactics evolve, VI will continue to take the easy way out of any "problem" by nerfing the spell/item to uselessness.<P>You can't change that and you can't complain to anyone in the position to make changes based on your complaint.  When VI makes a change, it's because they think it will make their game better. I think they are usually wrong, but it's still a decision they made and probably can't be changed.<P>Pre-Aggro: we have enough tanks, pet useless.<BR>High-Aggro Patches: wow..we can let the mage or necro pet tank for a few rounds while our main tank gets a heal.  If the pet dies..so what? It's only mana. Let's get a few more mage and necro pets out here.<BR>New-Aggro: pet useless again.<P> <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif">quote:</font><HR><BR>Can we just leave mages out of this conversation? it has nothingto do with them. <BR><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><BR>but it does..as a necro, <B>if</B>your success as a solo'ist and success at getting into groups depended solely on the power of your pet,  then I could see why the "reported" 49th lvl Necro pet nerf would be a big deal.  However; since, unlike a mage, it doesn't...what's the big deal?<P>I'm sure that if Sleethr was a necro and I had never been 100% dependent on my pet, I'd consider it a serious nerf.  I just don't see the necro class as being anywhere close to as dependant on their pet as a mage.   Maybe the grass is just greener on the other side of the fence for me, but I still think the necro class is way more powerful, flexable and group friendly then a mage. The SoL spell list just proves how much attention Necro's are getting towards being more group friendly.  <P>Sure, all the necros think the spells are crap...but it shows that VI is trying to make the Necro more groupable.<P>Now..look at the SoL mage spell list.  Wow!  I get to summon more useless crap that any 15th lvl n00bie would sneer at!<P>If I could call Verant and say, "Make Sleethr a Necro please" and have them do it...I would in a second.<P>--------------------<P>Verser - Bard of the 51st Song<BR>Sleethr - 54th DE Mage<BR>Medec - 41st level Battle Cleric<BR>Meekka - 33rd DE Rogue<BR>Vowk - 27th Dr00d
